 do with them open."},{"id":"elin","name":"Novice Elin","look":"elin","x":137,"y":75,"shop":"thornwatch_herbs","examine":"Novice Elin, keeping count of Mother Isolde's jars."},{"id":"gwen","name":"Gwen the smith","look":"gwen","x":107,"y":97,"shop":"thornwatch_forge","examine":"Gwen the smith, forearms like hams and burn scars like freckles."},{"id":"fennick","name":"Fennick the peddler","look":"fennick","x":88,"y":79,"shop":"thornwatch_peddler","examine":"Fennick the peddler. His prices go up when you look interested."},{"id":"rhosyn","name":"Captain Rhosyn","look":"rhosyn","x":123,"y":89,"quest":"sisters_barrow","quests":["sisters_barrow","smiths_hammer"],"examine":"Captain Rhosyn of the Thornwatch, three arrows short of a full quiver and not about to say why.","lines":["We hold this camp because there is nowhere left to fall back to. That makes it simple.","The archery butts are for the novices. The real practice is on the moor, and the targets move.","If you see a sister on the moor with her bow drawn on you, do not wait to ask which side she's on. Not any more."]},{"id":"hollin","name":"Old Hollin","look":"hollin","x":133,"y":79,"hideFlag":"seer_freed","quest":"drowned_tower","examine":"Old Hollin, the last of the seers, with a blanket round his shoulders and a bowl in his lap.","lines":["The stones remembered me. I wasn't sure they would.","Sit, sit. My eyes are poor but I see well enough what's coming.","Mind the fire. I have had enough of fire for one lifetime."]},{"id":"tavish","name":"Tavish the caravan master","look":"tavish","x":102,"y":84,"openFlag":"maiden_slain","examine":"Tavish the caravan master, whose wagons have not rolled since the road east closed.","linesOpen":["The road east is open! The thorns across it went black overnight and fell to dust. I'm told I have you to thank.","Wagons are loaded. Horses are fed. If you're ever going east, there's a seat up front with your name on it.","Three summers I sat here. Three. I'm going to miss the porridge, and nothing else."],"lines":["Three wagons, two horses, one road east, and that road's shut. So here I sit.","The Sisters feed us and we keep their stores dry. It's a fair trade. It's the only trade going.","When the road opens I'm leaving at a gallop, and you're welcome to ride along. Until then, there's the moor."]},{"id":"tw_chest","name":"Thornwatch chest","look":"chest","x":107,"y":84,"chest":true,"examine":"The Sisters' strongbox, iron-bound and chained to a stake. Everything you own from Ashvale is kept in your arcade wallet; this is where you see it."},{"id":"sentry_w","name":"Thornwatch sentry","look":"thorn_sentry","x":133,"y":60,"examine":"A Thornwatch sentry, watching the moor over the bridge.","lines":["Bridge is clear. For now.","Ashlings were at the fence-line at dusk. They always come back.","Keep to the trail and you'll see them before they see you."]},{"id":"sentry_e","name":"Thornwatch sentry","look":"thorn_sentry2","x":140,"y":60,"examine":"A Thornwatch sentry, watching the moor over the bridge.","lines":["Bridge is clear. For now.","Ashlings were at the fence-line at dusk. They always come back.","Keep to the trail and you'll see them before they see you."]}],"spawns":[],"fishing":[]}}